Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrists of siege hundreds in간г accessories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Wa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Guardians!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu!..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.87,0:01:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you just did,\Nso my friends are now free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks to me like everything's\Nback to normal around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean Yugi won the\Nduel. What? What duel? Your duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi took over when you and\NMokuba were turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he combined your deck with his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And he beat Noah! My deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He dueled using my cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.85,0:01:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been defeated, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just by me, but by all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.73,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For it was only with the support of my\Nfriends that I was able to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And the more you tried to destroy\Nthat friendship, the stronger it grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't how it was\Nsupposed to happen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.27,0:02:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been all alone in this\Nvirtual world for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's distorted your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.75,0:02:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been stuck in this\Ndigital wasteland for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the reason I despise\NYugi and his friends so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is because they share a bond\Nthat I've never experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So I tried to eliminate their friendship\Nto show them what it's like to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But they'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My life was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,After my accident, my brain was digitized\Ninto one of my father's supercomputers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,only to be forgotten about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised me everything\Nand left me with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve to be the\Npresident of Kaiba Corp!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would be if Seto\Nhadn't robbed me of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start by escaping to\Nthe real world and your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind is full of secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the secrets in his mind as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's us, but where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Try touching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence isn't going\Nto get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have failed, Noah, so\Nit's time to set us all free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And give me my real body back, pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you want your body back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your real body's exactly where\Nit's been since you arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the games, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no real bodies in my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here's virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That means all of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just trapped in a virtual\Nworld, we're all a part of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your real bodies are\Nstrapped into cyberpods
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,that are hardwired to\Nmy virtual simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So everything you've experienced\Nhere has only happened in your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why it seems so real here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds are being tricked into\Nfeeling things that aren't really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When the floor opened up, we\Ndidn't fall into a virtual vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We were knocked unconscious and\Nlocked in your cyber simulation pods!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You have failed me for\Nthe last time, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me another chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Zaburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I need time! More time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've had more than enough\Ntime to prove yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to finish things off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I digitized my own mind when\NSeto disgraced me by taking over my company!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've been behind\Nthis the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he has. Right, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's going to give Kyber Corp to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You had your chance, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you failed, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Pops, you had your chance also.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you failed when you lost Kyber\NCorp to someone more fit for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I taught you everything you know, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could outsmart me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you learned the\Ntruth about why I adopted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After you beat me at chess,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be the perfect\Nperson to motivate my real son, Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,who was quite a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So you just used him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah needed to work more on his studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Seto could give him the push he\Nneeded to someday take over Kyber Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But then Noah had his little accident,\Nand his body was rendered useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to preserve\Nhis mind in cyberspace,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but I soon realized he would\Nalways be the same spoiled brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Unworthy of inheriting my company,\Nso I turned my attention to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto I thought maybe you could\Nbe the heir to my fortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,so I pushed you to your limits
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:07:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave up on your own son, and you\Ntrapped me all alone in cyberspace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy Not at first
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Initially, I thought I could still\Nuse Seto to help you. Use me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And what was it you planned\Nto do with me, Gozoboro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Force me to play chess against your\Nvirtual son to increase his intellect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite, Seto. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I had something much more\Ninteresting planned. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you spit it out? Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Noah could learn how to run\Na multi-billion dollar corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he still lacked one major thing, a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's where you came in, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to transfer\NNoah's mind to Kaiba? Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That plan only lasted a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I give you Noah's mind\Nwhen yours was perfectly fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I concentrated on training you,\NSeto, so you could inherit my empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So using the same technology I used to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,download Noah's mind\Ninto my computer network,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I digitized my own mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,retreating to cyberspace\Nto plot my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I built this place for my final\Nplan, to take over your body myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, so you used me to trap them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only thing you did\Nright, but I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun and games are over. You snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that you had\Nthe nerve to call me a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the most powerful human\Nbeing on the entire planet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,before you came along and stole\Nthat power away from me, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that I treated you\Neven better than I treated my own son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for nothing, and I'll make\Nsure you never regain your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.71,0:08:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:08:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of my newest plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of the many\Nsatellites KaibaCorp
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,put into orbit when I was still in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,These satellites can beam signals to\Nevery computer system on Earth and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,connect them back to the underwater\Nbase that holds my supercomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No one on Earth will escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have access to\Nevery home on the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, that has to be the most\Nridiculous idea I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you feel that way, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the idea came from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember, my son? Hey, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working on a new idea that\Nyou might find quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out how to improve the quality\Nof the virtual world you created for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is connect our computer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,network to other systems\Nall around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, Seto, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer interested in taking control
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,of your body in order\Nto regain Kyber Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've set my sights on bigger things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can believe whatever\Nyou want about me, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because once my plan works,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the most powerful\Nbeing on the planet once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one on Earth will be able\Nto stop me this time. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about so much more than\Njust acquiring one company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For when I'm finished, everyone\Non Earth will become virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to digitize the entire world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will reign as the cyber\Nruler of a new planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's gone for now, but\Nyou have to escape quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know the way out, so follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And why should we believe you, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A possible exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,this is one of several remote\Nnetwork stations built by
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,my father it can give us\Naccess to all of the program's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,emergency exits but it seems\Nthat my father has locked the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,system and closed off every\Nexit to stop us from escaping
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,when he showed up again after six years\Nhe promised to help me but he was lying my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Father was using me. Kozaburo treated Noah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the same way he treated\NSeto With no respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure there are no\Nother exits around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe there's a way out\Nof here you're not thinking of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this monkey business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to wake up in my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.87,0:11:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to stop this old man\Nfrom digitizing the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't do that from in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Every virtual reality program has\Nmore than one emergency exit system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you try\Nthinking harder, Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to stay a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be alone in this virtual\Nworld for very much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My father said he's bringing\Nthe whole world in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means I'll never\Nhave to be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be one big happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in danger, too, and we\Nall have to work together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Moki, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I think I'm going nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Mokuba. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Noah's an evil jerk, but it's not\Nhis fault, and I think we can help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Something has just occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one more escape route here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a doorway that I created, and\Nit leads directly to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite sure my father\Nhas no idea that it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can escape and warn\Nthe world of his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting around here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I claim a body, I'll\Nbe making my escape alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to find those fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Noah's lying to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try telling me\Nsomething I don't already know, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so sure this is a trick,\Nthen why are you following him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always taught to\Nkeep my enemies close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kaiba's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Noah is trying to\Nhelp us now. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His dad betrayed him again, so Noah\Nmust want to stop him as much as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Noah and\NKaiba really have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They were both mistreated by Gozoboro,\Nand they need our help to defeat him. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all on the same team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you take it from here? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, where is this exit already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your freedom lies beyond this door
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you walk through,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll wake up in the real world\NI don't know about this, guys
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.55,0:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The real world is just beyond these doors
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he didn't leave without me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where else would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it out already. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,your friends may think they're free,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're really trapped\Nin their own memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems oddly familiar, like\NI've sat in this exact spot before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as I have Slifer\Nthe Sky Dragon in my deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Slifer, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Buster Blader, retaliate\Nwith your Dragon Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jam Defender, intercept!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attacks are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Merrick win my puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn't this duel happen already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret exit to the real world\Nis located inside this arcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it inside one of\Nthese video games? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, you won't\Nbe going home, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gaining on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, they'll catch up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just take Serenity and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some unfinished\Nbusiness to attend to. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Serenity, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross on the green, not in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what was it you were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel like we've\Ntaken this ride before?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Something weird is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything seems to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mai's doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mai's not just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, why don't we stop\Ndueling and just settle down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop dueling? For good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's just a dumb card game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I know this isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:18:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone tell me what's\Ngoing on? I don't know. I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah must have tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find that punk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaiba's gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Noah, I can't find the exit in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This video game has so many levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember which one you\Nhid the secret doorway in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never find out, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Close to having your\Nbody taken over, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape with us to\Nthe real world without a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.79,0:18:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I bet Seto can make you a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're our family, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be like your old body, but\Nat least you'll be in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the technology\Nexperts at Kaiba Corp
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,can construct some kind\Nof a robot body for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe we can be twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Noah, we are\Nbrothers, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba still likes me\Nafter all I've done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many games in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you hit the exit somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything looks exactly\Nthe same in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over there by that stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is kind of cool,\Nbut where's the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years, a body of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
